<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Modelo started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Modelo started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities analyst Lucrecia Tam started coverage of Mexican brewer Grupo Modelo SA Tuesday with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Top-line momentum (is) being driven by a recovery in the Mexican beer sector and soaring exports,&quot; she wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We expect annual revenues to grow an average of 16 percent (in dollar terms) in the next three years.&quot;</p>
<p>-- She set an 18-month price target of 87.40 pesos, or $9.50, implying a 25-percent increase in dollar terms.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
